// F-16 stabilator and fin. Symmetric. The -15..15 rows are the old NACA 0009
// table, unchanged, so cruise and small deflections read the same values.
// Past that, lift falls off from the +/-15 deg row to 0 at 90 deg, and drag
// becomes flat-plate drag (1.25 sin^2 alpha) once that exceeds the stalled
// 0.135. Illustrative, not official data. Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
